BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:symi-nimborio-panigiri-of-sotiris-transfiguration-nimborio-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Sotiris (Transfiguration)\, Nimborio
LOCATION:Nimborio\, Symi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Transfiguration is kept at Nimborio\, the bay a half-hour walk west of Gialos\, with vespers on the 5th and a feast in the courtyard with fried fish\, salads and wine\, and Symiot music\; it is also the 'Ag. Sotiris' night listed within the Symi Festival programme. Walk back along the coast road with a torch\, or take a water taxi.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/symi/#nimborio-panigiri-of-sotiris-transfiguration-nimborio
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/symi/#nimborio-panigiri-of-sotiris-transfiguration-nimborio
END:VEVENT
